  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Compare benchmark scores and estimated no-cache API and subscription rates in USD per 1M total tokens across Terminal-Bench, FrontierCode, and Terminal-Bench Science.">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://takumi3488.github.io/leaderboards/og-image.png">
  <meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Model comparison — benchmark scores and estimated no-cache API and subscription rates in USD per 1M total tokens">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --panel: #f2f5f9;
      --ink: #202e46;
      --muted: #556783;
      --rule: #d7e0ec;
      --action: #2454a6;
      --warn-bg: #fff5e8;
      --warn-ink: #754813;
      --sans: "Avenir Next", "Trebuchet MS", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    a { color: var(--action); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
    :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #8fb5f0; outline-offset: 3px; }
    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8px;
      left: 8px;
      z-index: 5;
      transform: translateY(-160%);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: white;
    }
    .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
    .page { width: min(1500px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px 44px; }
    .masthead {
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 25px 0 21px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.15; }
    .subtitle { margin: 7px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .updated { max-width: 420px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .87rem; text-align: right; }
    .updated p { margin: 2px 0; }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 15px 28px;
      margin: 20px 0 13px;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    .control { min-width: 150px; }
    .control > label, .control legend { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 650; }
    select {
      min-height: 40px;
      min-width: min(280px, 80vw);
      padding: 7px 34px 7px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #9cabc0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: inherit;
    }
    fieldset { min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
    fieldset legend { padding: 0; }
    .choice-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 16px; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; }
    .choice-row label, .sub-option { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; cursor: pointer; }
    input[type="radio"], input[type="checkbox"] { width: 17px; height: 17px; margin: 0; accent-color: var(--action); flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .sub-panel {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      padding: 13px 17px 15px;
      border: 1px solid var(--rule);
      background: #fbfcfe;
    }
    .sub-heading { margin: 0; cursor: pointer; }
    .sub-heading-content { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 12px; margin-left: 5px; }
    .sub-heading-title, .section-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 650; }
    .sub-count { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }
    .sub-instruction { margin: 10px 0 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }
    .sub-option { min-height: 35px; justify-content: flex-start; padding: 5px 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .sub-option-text { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 3px 9px; }
    .sub-option-name { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .sub-option-meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); }
    .analysis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 280px; gap: 14px; align-items: stretch; }
    .chart-panel, .model-panel { min-width: 0; border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); }
    .chart-panel { padding: 13px 15px 10px; }
    .chart-topline { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; padding: 0 4px; }
    .chart-topline h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 650; }
    .chart-count { color: var(--muted); font-size: .83rem; text-align: right; }
    #chart { width: 100%; height: 560px; }
    .chart-note { min-height: 1.4em; margin: 0 4px 5px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }
    .chart-empty, .chart-failure { margin: 0 4px 8px; padding: 10px 12px; border-left: 3px solid var(--action); background: var(--panel); color: var(--ink); }
    .chart-failure { border-color: #ad6a12; background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn-ink); }
    .model-panel { padding: 15px 15px 12px; }
    .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .model-help { margin: 0 0 11px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }
    .model-list { max-height: 500px; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; }
    .model-option { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 17px 13px minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 35px; padding: 5px 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6ebf2; cursor: pointer; }
    .model-option span:last-child { overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .88rem; }
    .swatch { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid currentColor; }
    .table-section { margin-top: 25px; }
    .table-intro { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 9px; }
    .table-intro p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }
    .table-scroll { overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    table { width: 100%; min-width: 900px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; }
    th, td { padding: 9px 11px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
    thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1; background: var(--panel); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 650; }
    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    tbody tr:hover { background: #f8fafd; }
    .numeric { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
    .money { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
    .basis { min-width: 160px; }
    .methodology { margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 17px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .methodology h2, .sources h2 { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .methodology p { max-width: 1000px; margin: 4px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; }
    .sources { margin-top: 20px; }
    .source-list { display: grid; gap: 5px; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
    .source-list li { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .source-date { margin-left: 6px; }
    .source-list a { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .tip-title { margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: 700; }
    .tip-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; margin-top: 2px; }
    .tip-label { color: #607086; }
    .fallback-legend { margin: 2px 4px 5px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .81rem; }
    .fallback-dot { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-right: 4px; vertical-align: -2px; border: 2px solid var(--action); border-radius: 50%; background: white; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .analysis { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .model-panel { order: 2; }
      .model-list { max-height: 255px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); column-gap: 12px; }
      #chart { height: 500px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .page { padding: 0 14px 32px; }
      .masthead { display: block; padding: 19px 0 15px; }
      .updated { margin-top: 11px; text-align: left; }
      .controls { align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px 20px; padding: 13px; }
      .control { width: 100%; }
      .control select { width: 100%; }
      .choice-row { min-height: 32px; }
      .sub-heading-content { display: flex; }
      .chart-panel { padding: 11px 8px 8px; }
      .chart-topline { align-items: start; }
      #chart { height: 430px; }
      .model-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .table-intro { display: block; }
      .table-intro p { margin-top: 3px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#results" data-i18n="skipLink">Skip to results</a>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="masthead">
      <div>
        <h1 data-i18n="titleHeading">Model comparison</h1>
        <p id="report-subtitle" class="subtitle" data-i18n="subtitle">Benchmark score and estimated no-cache USD per 1M total tokens</p>
      </div>
      <div class="updated" aria-label="Data update information" data-i18n-aria-label="updatedLabel">
        <p><span data-i18n="generatedAtLabel">Report generated:</span> <time id="generated-at"></time></p>
        <p><span data-i18n="subscriptionUpdatedLabel">Pricing data:</span> <time id="subscription-updated"></time></p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="results">
      <section class="controls" aria-label="Comparison settings" data-i18n-aria-label="controlsLabel">
        <div class="control">
          <label for="benchmark-select" data-i18n="benchmarkLabel">Benchmark</label>
          <select id="benchmark-select"></select>
        </div>
        <fieldset class="control">
          <legend data-i18n="costDisplayLegend">Billing</legend>
          <div class="choice-row">
            <label><input type="radio" name="cost-mode" value="api"> <span data-i18n="apiMode">API estimate</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="cost-mode" value="subscription" checked> <span data-i18n="subscriptionMode">Subscription estimate</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="control">
          <legend data-i18n="costBasisLegend">Pricing basis</legend>
          <div class="choice-row">
            <label><input type="radio" name="cost-basis" value="unit" checked> <span data-i18n="unitCostBasis">Per 1M tokens (estimate)</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="cost-basis" value="rollout"> <span data-i18n="rolloutCostBasis">Per rollout estimate</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="control">
          <legend data-i18n="axisScaleLegend">X-axis scale</legend>
          <div class="choice-row">
            <label><input type="radio" name="axis-scale" value="log" checked> <span data-i18n="logScale">Logarithmic</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="axis-scale" value="linear"> <span data-i18n="linearScale">Linear</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </section>

      <details id="subscription-panel" class="sub-panel" aria-labelledby="subscription-heading">
        <summary class="sub-heading">
          <span class="sub-heading-content">
            <span id="subscription-heading" class="sub-heading-title" data-i18n="subscriptionHeading">Plans used for estimates</span>
            <span id="enabled-plan-count" class="sub-count" aria-live="polite"></span>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="sub-instruction" data-i18n="subscriptionInstruction">Toggle plans individually; the lowest enabled matching plan is used for each model.</p>
        <div id="subscription-list" class="sub-list"></div>
      </details>

      <section class="analysis" aria-label="Score and estimated price comparison" data-i18n-aria-label="analysisLabel">
        <div class="chart-panel">
          <div class="chart-topline">
            <h2 data-i18n="chartHeading">Score × unit price</h2>
            <div id="chart-count" class="chart-count" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
          <p id="chart-note" class="chart-note" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <p id="fallback-legend" class="fallback-legend"><span class="fallback-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span data-i18n="fallbackLegend">Hollow circles show the estimated API value used when no enabled subscription plan matches</span></p>
          <p id="chart-empty" class="chart-empty" hidden></p>
          <p id="chart-failure" class="chart-failure" role="status" hidden data-i18n="chartFailure">The chart library could not be loaded. Check your network connection. The results table is still available.</p>
          <div id="chart" role="img" aria-label="Scatter plot of benchmark score and estimated USD per 1M total tokens" data-i18n-aria-label="chartLabel"></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="model-panel" aria-labelledby="model-heading">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="model-heading" data-i18n="modelsHeading">Models</h2></div>
          <p class="model-help" data-i18n="modelHelp">Choose models to display</p>
          <div id="model-list" class="model-list"></div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="table-section" aria-labelledby="table-heading">
        <div class="table-intro">
          <h2 id="table-heading" style="margin:0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:650" data-i18n="resultsHeading">Results</h2>
          <p id="results-description" data-i18n="resultsDescription">Displayed values are estimated USD per 1M total tokens. Filtered by the current settings, sorted by score (highest first)</p>
        </div>
        <div id="table-scroll" class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="Estimated API and selected prices in USD per 1M total tokens. Scroll horizontally to view all columns" data-i18n-aria-label="tableScrollLabel">
          <table>
            <thead><tr>
              <th scope="col" data-i18n="modelColumn">Model</th>
              <th scope="col" data-i18n="agentColumn">Agent</th>
              <th scope="col" data-i18n="effortColumn">Effort</th>
              <th scope="col" class="numeric" id="table-score-heading" data-i18n="scoreHeader">Score</th>
              <th scope="col" class="numeric" id="api-usd-heading" data-i18n="apiUsdColumn">Estimated API USD / 1M total tokens</th>
              <th scope="col" class="numeric" id="display-usd-heading" data-i18n="displayUsdColumn">Selected estimate USD / 1M total tokens</th>
              <th scope="col" data-i18n="costBasisColumn">Rate basis</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="results-body"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="methodology" aria-labelledby="methodology-heading">
        <h2 id="methodology-heading" data-i18n="methodologyHeading">How to read this report</h2>
        <p id="benchmark-definition"></p>
        <p id="api-rate-methodology" data-i18n="apiRateMethodology">API unit rates are no-cache estimates in USD per 1M total tokens: (5 × input price + output price) ÷ 6, a normalized 5:1 input-to-output mix. Cached input and cache-write prices are excluded. Components are selected in this order: valid metered input/output, hand-maintained official input/output, then valid components from other source rows. These estimates are not the original observed API costs.</p>
        <p id="subscription-methodology" data-i18n="subscriptionMethodology">Subscription rates are estimates: each source subscription rate is scaled by the ratio of the new no-cache API rate to its legacy API reference rate. This assumes the monthly allowance is fully used and the subscription discount rate remains unchanged; it is not observed subscription spend. For rollouts, reported tokens are multiplied by the estimated rate; otherwise, original API cost is used only to infer equivalent token volume. Missing inputs show —, without API fallback.</p>
        <p data-i18n="scoreMethodology">Compare scores within each benchmark only. Scores from different benchmarks are not combined or directly comparable.</p>
        <p id="benchmark-link-row"></p>
      </section>

      <section class="sources" aria-labelledby="sources-heading">
        <h2 id="sources-heading" data-i18n="sourcesHeading">Data sources</h2>
        <ul id="source-list" class="source-list"></ul>
      </section>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="report-data">{{.ReportJSON}}</script>
